  dialogueLines:
  - "\u201CI'll give you five thousand dollars for her. Think about it. That's a lot of premium soil.\u201D "
  - '"Your... girlfriend? Right. Of course. Love is beautiful, I guess. But if you ever change your mind, here''s my card."  '
  - "\u201CTEN THOUSAND?! You drive a hard bargain. Give me a minute to call my bank. And possibly my lawyer.  \"  "
  - '"A hat? For the worm? ...You know what, sure. I''ll find the fanciest tiny hat money can buy. "  '
